{"t":"ROK","made":"2026-11-11 10:29","name":"Rockwell Automation, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","employees":27000,"hq":"Milwaukee, WI, United States","website":"https://www.rockwellautomation.com","summary_en":"Rockwell Automation, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides industrial automation and digital transformation solutions in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. It operates in three segments: Intelligent Devices, Software & Control, and Lifecycle Services. The company offers drives, motion, advanced material handling, safety, sensing, industrial components, hardware, software, and configured-to-order products; and control and visualization software and hardware, digital twin, simulation and information software, network and security infrastructure, and custom-engineered systems. It also provides digital consulting, professional services, engineered-to-order solutions, recurring services, cybersecurity, safety, remote monitoring, customer technical support and repair, asset management and optimization consulting, and training, as well as spare parts. The company sells its products through independent distributors in relation to its direct sales force. It serves discrete end markets, including automotive, semiconductor, e-commerce, and warehouse automation; hybrid end markets, such as food and beverage, life sciences, and tire; and process end markets comprising energy, mining, and chemicals. The company was formerly known as Rockwell International Corporation and changed its name to Rockwell Automation, Inc. in February 2002. Rockwell Automation, Inc. was founded in 1903 and is headquartered in Milwaukee, Wisconsin.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Rockwell Automation, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 북미, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 아시아 태평양 및 라틴 아메리카에 산업 자동화 및 디지털 전환 솔루션을 제공합니다. 지능형 장치, 소프트웨어 및 제어, 라이프사이클 서비스의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 드라이브, 모션, 첨단 자재 취급, 안전, 감지, 산업용 부품, 하드웨어, 소프트웨어 및 주문형 제품을 제공합니다. 제어 및 시각화 소프트웨어와 하드웨어, 디지털 트윈, 시뮬레이션 및 정보 소프트웨어, 네트워크 및 보안 인프라, 맞춤형 엔지니어링 시스템 등이 포함됩니다. 또한 디지털 컨설팅, 전문 서비스, 주문형 솔루션, 반복 서비스, 사이버 보안, 안전, 원격 모니터링, 고객 기술 지원 및 수리, 자산 관리 및 최적화 컨설팅, 교육, 예비 부품도 제공합니다. 회사는 직접 판매 인력과 관련하여 독립 유통업체를 통해 제품을 판매합니다. 자동차, 반도체, 전자상거래, 창고 자동화 등 개별 최종 시장에 서비스를 제공합니다. 식품 및 음료, 생명과학, 타이어 등 하이브리드 최종 시장; 에너지, 광업, 화학제품으로 구성된 최종 시장을 처리합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Rockwell International Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2002년 2월에 Rockwell Automation, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Rockwell Automation, Inc.는 1903년에 설립되었으며 위스콘신 주 밀워키에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":397.16,"mcap":44193562624.0,"pe":31.671452,"fpe":23.792465,"peg":1.6612,"ps":4.9164047,"pb":12.422507,"ev_ebitda":23.873,"div":1.49,"beta":1.515,"hi52":497.36,"lo52":347.53},"fin":{"rev":8988999680.0,"rev_g":0.007,"eps_g":1.528,"gross":0.48949,"op":0.14751,"net":0.15675001,"roe":0.38734,"fcf":-471249984.0,"cash":433000000.0,"debt":3552000000.0,"de":99.944,"eps":12.54,"feps":16.69268},"own":{"short":0.037100002,"inst":0.92572,"insider":0.00166},"analyst":{"n":25,"mean":448.76,"median":452.0,"high":520.0,"low":295.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.28571,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":15,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":9,"hold":15,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":10,"hold":14,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":504.0,"priorPriceTarget":536.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Stephens & Co.","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":500.0,"priorPriceTarget":550.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"In-Line","FromGrade":"In-Line","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":425.0,"pri